[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   Run a batch of ``hops`` commands in one process against one connection.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   Reads newline-separated ``hops`` commands (each WITHOUT the leading
[agent:result]   ``hops``, though a leading ``hops`` is tolerated) from FILE or, when no
[agent:result]   ``-f`` is given, from stdin. Blank lines and lines starting with ``#`` are
[agent:result]   skipped. The SDK login performed by the first command that needs it is
[agent:result]   reused by the rest, so a 10-step feature pipeline pays one login instead of
[agent:result]   ten.
[agent:result] 
